    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "DC- 9-30 Series\nFor the safety of others, please do not remove this card from the airplane.\nSafety\nInformation\nFor your safety, follow instructions given by the crew\nand study the contents of this card.\nLearn where ALL of the exits are on this airplane.\nComply with all signs and placards.\nKeep your seatbelt fastened when the \"Seatbelt\" sign is on.\nNo smoking at any time.\nSITTING IN AN EXIT ROW SEAT...\nGovernment regulations require that a passenger seated in a\ndesignated exit row seat notify a crew member prior to departure if:\nYou do not read, speak or understand the language in which\nyour flight crew delivers the pre-flight briefing.\nValujet\nAIRLINES",
      "OR\n93111\n5 g\nTAIL EXIT\n2\n5",
      ":01\n3\n:03\n:05\n:07\n:10\nCopyright\nCode 95222 Revised 12/95\n1995 SAFEAIR, INC. Olympia, WA., (360)754-5837. All Rights Reserved."
